{"ref":"BDB, נַ֫עַל","hw":"נַ֫עַל","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">נַ֫עַל</span></big>  <strong>n.f.</strong> <sup>Jos 9:5</sup> <strong>sandal, shoe (</strong>NH <em>id.;</em> Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">نَعْلٌ</span> <em>id.</em> (also <em>horse-shoe</em>, etc.); Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܢܰܥܠܴܐ</span> appar. only <em>horse-shoe</em> (rare; also NS) PS<sup>2405</sup>; cf. poss. Ethiopic ንዑልት: (obsol.) <em>wife of Levirate marriage</em> Di<sup>676</sup><strong>)</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 14:23\" href=\"/Genesis.14.23\">Gn 14:23</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נָ֑עַל</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 25:10\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.25.10\">Dt 25:10</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">נַעֲלִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 60:10\" href=\"/Psalms.60.10\">ψ 60:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 108:10\" href=\"/Psalms.108.10\">108:10</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נַעַלְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 5:15\" href=\"/Joshua.5.15\">Jos 5:15</a>, etc.; du. <span dir=\"rtl\">נַעֲלָ֑יִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 2:6\" href=\"/Amos.2.6\">Am 2:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Amos 8:6\" href=\"/Amos.8.6\">8:6</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִ֑עָלִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 11:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.11.15\">Is 11:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 7:2\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.7.2\">Ct 7:2</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נְעָלוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:5\" href=\"/Joshua.9.5\">Jos 9:5</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְעָלֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 3:5\" href=\"/Exodus.3.5\">Ex 3:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 24:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.24.17\">Ez 24:17</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נְעָלָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:27\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.27\">Is 5:27</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נְעָלֵינוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:13\" href=\"/Joshua.9.13\">Jos 9:13</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נַעֲלֵיכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:11\" href=\"/Exodus.12.11\">Ex 12:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 24:23\" href=\"/Ezekiel.24.23\">Ez 24:23</a>;—<em>sandal</em> <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:13\" href=\"/Judges.9.13\">Ju 9:13</a>, <a data-